## Checklist — DECOMPOSE → Impl skills (situational)

На каждый `sNN`: yes → добавь путь. Cap situational ≤ **6** (+ Core из `workflow-decompose`).

| # | Вопрос | skill |
|---|--------|-------|
| 1 | Доминирующий surface? → `code_surface:` `service\|api\|sql\|ws\|model\|infra\|test` | — |
| 2 | HTTP routes / schemas / envelope / DI? | `fastapi-templates` |
| 3 | async I/O / concurrent / FastAPI handlers / WS tasks? | `async-python-patterns` |
| 4 | domain/HTTP/envelope ошибки (не docs-only)? | `python-error-handling` |
| 5 | ORM / Alembic / asyncpg session? | `sqlalchemy-postgres` |
| 6 | raw SQL / indexes / Postgres best practices? | `supabase-postgres-best-practices` |
| 7 | WebSocket / fanout / Redis realtime? | `websocket-engineer` |
| 8 | hot-path / downsample / series / perf? | `python-performance-optimization` |
| 9 | settings / env / config load? | `python-configuration` |
| 10 | health / metrics / structured logs / telemetry? | `python-observability` |
| 11 | rate-limit / retry / timeout / circuit? | `python-resilience` |
| 12 | новые публичные типы / Pydantic / typing API? | `python-type-safety` |

**Defaults (не docs-only):** `api` → #2–4; `service` → #3–4; `ws` → #3 #4 #7; `sql` → #5 (+#6 если SQL); `infra` → #9/#10/#11 только по факту.

